      <![CDATA[<h1 id="C-STL容器：map-set"><a href="#C-STL容器：map-set" class="headerlink" title="C++STL容器：map&amp;set"></a>C++STL容器：map&amp;set</h1><h2 id="map"><a href="#map" class="headerlink" title="map"></a>map</h2><h3 id="定义"><a href="#定义" class="headerlink" title="定义"></a>定义</h3><p><code>map&lt;Typename1, Typename2&gt; Yourtype;</code><br>值得注意的一点是，map重载了operator[]，可以跟数组一样当下标用。<br>一个使用map的实例：<br><code>map&lt;int, int&gt; ty;</code><br>值得注意的是，当创建字符串对整数的映射是，只能用string，而不能用int<br>map中不存在相同元素</p><h3 id="插入与删除"><a href="#插入与删除" class="headerlink" title="插入与删除"></a>插入与删除</h3><p>可直接通过下标访问，如<code>mp[&quot;aaa&quot;]=100;</code><br>向map中插入一个pair即可插入元素，如<code>mp.insert[pair&lt;string,int&gt;(&quot;aaa&quot;,100)];</code></p><ul><li><code>mp.erase(key)</code>将会删除所有键值为key的元素，返回值为删除元素的数量</li><li><code>mp.erase(pos)</code>删除迭代器为pos的元素，迭代器必须有意义且不可为空</li><li><code>mp.erase(first,last)</code>删除迭代器在[first,last)内的所有元素</li><li><code>mp.clear()</code>清空整个容器<br>在用下标访问的过程中，尤其需要注意的是，如果map中不存在下标，将会直接创建一个下标，对应默认键值，当空下标过多时，将会极大地影响map的效率，所以一般使用<code>mp.find()</code>查找元素</li></ul><h3 id="查询"><a href="#查询" class="headerlink" title="查询"></a>查询</h3><ul><li><code>mp.count(x)</code>返回键为x的元素个数，对数复杂度</li><li><code>mp.find(x)</code>返回x的迭代器，否则返回end()</li><li><code>mp.lower_bound(x)</code>返回首个大于等于给定键的元素的迭代器</li><li><code>mp.upper_bound(x)</code>返回首个大于给定键的元素的迭代器，若不存在这样的迭代器，返回end()</li><li><code>mp.empty()</code>返回容器是否为空</li><li><code>mp.size()</code>返回容器中元素个数</li></ul><h3 id="map用于存储复杂状态"><a href="#map用于存储复杂状态" class="headerlink" title="map用于存储复杂状态"></a>map用于存储复杂状态</h3><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">//存储状态与对应答案    </span></span><br><span class="line">map&lt;string,<span class="type">int</span>&gt; record;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//新搜索到的状态与对应答案</span></span><br><span class="line">string status;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> ans;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//查找对应状态是否出现过</span></span><br><span class="line">map&lt;string,<span class="type">int</span>&gt;::iterator it=record.<span class="built_in">find</span>(status);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span>(it==record.<span class="built_in">end</span>())&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//尚未搜索过，将其加入状态记录中</span></span><br><span class="line">    record[status]=ans;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//相应操作...</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">else</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//已经搜索过，进行操作...</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="set"><a href="#set" class="headerlink" title="set"></a>set</h2><h3 id="定义-1"><a href="#定义-1" class="headerlink" title="定义"></a>定义</h3><p>值得注意的是，与map不同，set中不会出现指相同的元素（这里可没有键）</p><h3 id="插入与删除-1"><a href="#插入与删除-1" class="headerlink" title="插入与删除"></a>插入与删除</h3><ul><li><code>insert(x)</code> 将元素x插入到set中，返回值为<code>pair&lt;iterator,bool&gt;</code>iterator代表迭代器，bool代表是否插入成功</li><li><code>erase(x)</code>删除值为x的元素</li><li><code>erase(pos)</code>删除迭代器为pos的元素，要求迭代器必须合法</li><li><code>erase(first,last)</code>删除迭代器在[first,last)范围内的所有元素</li><li><code>clear()</code>清空set</li></ul><h3 id="迭代器"><a href="#迭代器" class="headerlink" title="迭代器"></a>迭代器</h3><ol><li><code>begin()</code>指向首元素的迭代器</li><li><code>end()</code>指向末端占位符的迭代器，注意没有元素</li><li><code>rbegin()</code>指向末元素</li><li><code>rend()</code>指向容器首的前一个元素</li></ol><h3 id="查找"><a href="#查找" class="headerlink" title="查找"></a>查找</h3><ul><li><code>count(x)</code>返回键为x的元素数量</li><li><code>find(x)</code>返回x的迭代器，否则返回end()</li><li><code>lower_bound(x)</code>返回首个大于等于给定键的元素的迭代器</li><li><code>upper_bound(x)</code>返回首个大于给定键的元素的迭代器，若不存在这样的迭代器，返回end()</li><li><code>empty()</code>返回容器是否为空</li><li><code>size()</code>返回容器中元素个数<br>注意，<code>lower_bound</code>和<code>upper_bnoud</code>为对数时间复杂度<br>set中没有<code>nth_element</code>，而使用<code>algorithm</code>中的该函数时间复杂度为O(n)</li></ul><h3 id="set于贪心的应用"><a href="#set于贪心的应用" class="headerlink" title="set于贪心的应用"></a>set于贪心的应用</h3><p>用于找出并删除最小的大于某个值的元素，这种操作使用set可以轻松完成</p><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">//现存可用元素</span></span><br><span class="line">set&lt;<span class="type">int</span>&gt; ava;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//需要大于等于的值</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="type">int</span> x;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">//查找最小的大于等于x的元素</span></span><br><span class="line">set&lt;<span class="type">int</span>&gt;::iterator it=ava.<span class="built_in">lower_bound</span>(x);</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">if</span>(it==ava.<span class="built_in">end</span>())&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//不存在</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">else</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//存在，移除</span></span><br><span class="line">    ava.<span class="built_in">erase</span>(it);</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">//...</span></span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="遍历容器"><a href="#遍历容器" class="headerlink" title="遍历容器"></a>遍历容器</h2><p>可以用迭代器来遍历set或map容器的所有元素</p><figure class="highlight c++"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">//Only for C++11+</span></span><br><span class="line">set&lt;<span class="type">int</span>&gt; s;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">for</span>(<span class="keyword">auto</span> x:s) cout&lt;&lt;x&lt;&lt;endl;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>时间复杂度O(n)</p><hr><p>全文完，C++入门教程永远都不会再更新了<br>LightMC</p>]]>
    </content>
